  <Client>k__BackingField: {fileID: 11400000, guid: c710770abf287dc46b346fe2f2467822, type: 2}
  <TextContent>k__BackingField: 'Sugar Plum,


    I hope you''re well installed
    in your new home. I let you a few books that you might love before leaving. Don''t
    forget to eat well or you''ll be all skin and bone.


    Here''s a few coins
    to help you accessing the forest. Go for a stroll, you''ll find amazing mushrooms.


    Love'
